        "id": 227719,
        "name": "carnilius",
        "username": "carnilius",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/d07c76/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2019-06-03T19:09:23.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The easier way to think about it is that powers do not have a target until you use them, even if you have plans for how you might use them. &nbsp;That way&nbsp;you can play powers without worrying about if they have a target yet but know they are likely to help and give you needed elements. &nbsp;Also lets you coordinate with other Spirits after you've already played powers, but before they're used.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
